## Color palette

Use a restrained palette:
- Deep charcoal and midnight navy for menus and interface surfaces.
- Warm metallic gold for wealth, rewards, and prestigious items.
- Electric blue for interactive elements.
- Violet for selected rare and mysterious items.
- White and cool grey for readable text.
