# 20. ACCEPTANCE TESTS

Test with at least two independent accounts.

Verify that:
- Both players can enter the same world.
- They see one another moving in real time.
- Private room codes work.
- Player appearance persists after relogging.
- Base layouts persist.
- Purchases update the inventory and balance correctly.
- Marketplace sales transfer ownership exactly once.
- Auctions award the correct item to the correct winner.
- Trades cannot duplicate items or currency.
- Vault Duel results are validated and saved.
- Disconnects do not duplicate rewards.
- Full rooms reject additional players.
- Players cannot alter their currency through browser tools.
- Players cannot access private inventories.
- Simultaneous purchase attempts cannot both acquire a unique item.
- Invalid actions produce clear errors rather than inconsistent data.

Do not claim that a feature is complete merely because its screen exists.

If a feature requires an external service or configuration, explain exactly what is missing.

