# FINAL OBJECTIVE

Deliver VAULTBOUND as a persistent, social 3D browser game where friends can meet in a shared city, customize their characters, visit bases, collect rare objects, trade and bid in a living marketplace, compete in an original strategic game, take calculated risks, and build long-term wealth.

The first priority is not to create the largest possible world. It is to create a small, beautiful, functional world that people genuinely want to return to.

**Build a playable game first, then expand it into a complete multiplayer economy and social world.**